[38;2;124;124;124mThe Riemann zeta function ζ(s) has non-trivial zeros in the critical strip 0 < [0m
[38;2;124;124;124mRe(s) < 1. The Riemann Hypothesis states all non-trivial zeros have Re(s) = 1/2.[0m
